@startuml 2.2.13_Search_L3
title L3 – Search Qualifications
actor LO as "Logistics Operator"
participant UI as "SPA"
participant API as "PortOps API"
database DB as "DB"

LO -> UI : Search by code/name
UI -> API : GET /api/qualifications?code=...&name=...
API -> DB : SELECT ... WHERE code LIKE OR name LIKE ORDER BY code
DB --> API : Rows[]
API --> UI : 200 [ {code,name}, ... ]
@enduml